nFor $x$:\n\nOver the full turn, $\\cos\\theta$ attains both $-1$ and $1$, including at permitted parameter values.\n\nMultiply by $1$ and translate by $-4$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-1 &\\le \\cos\\theta\\le 1 \\\\\n-5 &\\le \\cos\\theta-4\\le -3 \\\\\n-5 &\\le x\\le -3.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus $-5\\le x\\le -3$.\n\nFor $y$:\n\nOver the full turn, $\\sin\\theta$ attains both $-1$ and $1$, including at permitted parameter values.\n\nMultiply by $1$ and translate by $2$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-1 &\\le \\sin\\theta\\le 1 \\\\\n1 &\\le \\sin\\theta+2\\le 3 \\\\\n1 &\\le y\\le 3.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus $1\\le y\\le 3$.\n\nContinuity gives every value between the stated bounds. The coordinate extrema need not occur at the same parameter value."] [:db/add "b77e3456-da7a-5a0c-9cae-79647351a0a8" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "b77e3456-da7a-5a0c-9cae-79647351a0a8" :question/answer-fields "741b33d6-1644-57ea-aacb-3ef0e3130806"] [:db/add "b77e3456-da7a-5a0c-9cae-79647351a0a8" :question/answer-fields "5f9bbd67-981c-58a9-b74c-c7f3d24bcb4a"] [:db/add "b77e3456-da7a-5a0c-9cae-79647351a0a8" :question/answer-fields "15117c8c-0dec-5660-a8aa-c2192f5f49f7"] [:db/add "b77e3456-da7a-5a0c-9cae-79647351a0a8" :question/answer-fields "08c486d1-64da-516b-97cf-ef21f4e2b5de"] [:db/add "b77e3456-da7a-5a0c-9cae-79647351a0a8" :question/answer-fields "59a76533-84b2-54d6-8056-a6efa204f98f"] [:db/add "b77e3456-da7a-5a0c-9cae-79647351a0a8" :question/answer-fields "220d2a01-892c-5fd0-a428-d0f9ebcc1b06"] [:db/ensure "b77e3456-da7a-5a0c-9cae-79647351a0a8" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186087736 :knowledge-point/questions "b77e3456-da7a-5a0c-9cae-79647351a0a8"] [:db/add "b30db420-af08-5e32-a111-df70bf05b36f" :answer/id #uuid "b30db420-af08-5e32-a111-df70bf05b36f"] [:db/add "b30db420-af08-5e32-a111-df70bf05b36f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "b30db420-af08-5e32-a111-df70bf05b36f" :answer/value "-6"] [:db/ensure "b30db420-af08-5e32-a111-df70bf05b36f" :an