 [:db/add "92ea78f7-e4b0-5e8b-8806-4623c088e16f" :answer-field/correct "7694ac11-7801-5d3f-9e16-d2a8bfb97770"] [:db/ensure "92ea78f7-e4b0-5e8b-8806-4623c088e16f" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "16e648e1-937e-5368-b06e-7c8ea72c9581" :answer/id #uuid "16e648e1-937e-5368-b06e-7c8ea72c9581"] [:db/add "16e648e1-937e-5368-b06e-7c8ea72c9581" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "16e648e1-937e-5368-b06e-7c8ea72c9581" :answer/value "7"] [:db/ensure "16e648e1-937e-5368-b06e-7c8ea72c9581" :answer/validate] [:db/add "1e43838d-e272-5e8c-bd37-2a75b0496763" :answer-field/id #uuid "1e43838d-e272-5e8c-bd37-2a75b0496763"] [:db/add "1e43838d-e272-5e8c-bd37-2a75b0496763" :answer-field/key "field-6"] [:db/add "1e43838d-e272-5e8c-bd37-2a75b0496763" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "1e43838d-e272-5e8c-bd37-2a75b0496763" :answer-field/choices "16e648e1-937e-5368-b06e-7c8ea72c9581"] [:db/add "1e43838d-e272-5e8c-bd37-2a75b0496763" :answer-field/correct "16e648e1-937e-5368-b06e-7c8ea72c9581"] [:db/ensure "1e43838d-e272-5e8c-bd37-2a75b0496763" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "38400543-5454-505c-aa07-5aa5dfad027c" :question/id #uuid "38400543-5454-505c-aa07-5aa5dfad027c"] [:db/add "38400543-5454-505c-aa07-5aa5dfad027c" :question/problem "Given that a curve is defined parametrically as\n\n$$\nx=6\\cos\\theta\n$$\n\n$$\ny=7\\sin\\theta\n$$\n\n$$\n0\\le \\theta<2\\pi\n$$\n\nwhat are the ranges of $x$ and $y$?\n\nThe range of $x$ is:\n\n{{field-1}} {{field-2}} $x\\le$ {{field-3}}.\n\nThe range of $y$ is:\n\n{{field-4}} $\\le y$ {{field-5}} {{field-6}}."] [:db/add "38400543-5454-505c-aa07-5aa5dfad027c" :question/worked-solution "Consider each coordinate separately.\n\nFor $x$:\n\nOver the full turn, $\\cos\\theta$ attains both $-1$ and $1$, including at permitted parameter values.\n\nMultiply by $6$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-1 &\\le \\cos\\theta\\le 1 \\\\\n-6 &\\le 6\\cos\\theta\\le 6 \\\\\n-6 &\\le x\\le 6.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus $-6\\le x\\le 6$.\n\nFor $y$:\n\nOver the full turn, $\\sin\\theta$ attains both $-1$ and $1$, including at permitted parameter values.\n\nMultiply by $7$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-1 &\\le \\sin\\theta\\le 1 \\\\\n-7 &\\le 7\\sin\\theta\\le 7 \\\\\n-7 &\\le y\\le 7.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus $-7\\le y\\le 7$.\n\nContinuity gives every value between the stated bounds. The coordinate extrema need not occur at the same parameter value."] [:db/add "38400543-5454-505c-aa07-5aa5dfad027c" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "38400543-5454-505c-aa07-5aa5dfad027c" :question/answer-fields "9709d495-1da1-5ecf-92c4-02e7a32db35a"] [:db/add "38400543-5454-505c-aa07-5aa5dfad027c" :question/answer-fields "183b2534-d086-57aa-a19f-3a7e6c2f4625"] [:db/add "38400543-5454-505c-aa07-5aa5dfad027c" :question/answer-fields "02ffc999-4586-5ca2-a862-85f323ed39a3"] [:db/add "38400543-5454-505c-aa07-5aa5dfad027c" :question/answer-fields "8cdd42f1-eb04-5925-a77e-ee0974afb15b"] [:db/add "38400543-5454-505c-aa07-5aa5dfad027c" :question/answer-fields "92ea78f7-e4b0-5e8b-8806-4623c088e16f"] [:db/add "38400543-5454-505c-aa07-5aa5dfad027c" :question/answer-fields "1e43838d-e272-5e8c-bd37-2a75b0496763"] [:db/ensure "38400543-5454-505c-aa07-5aa5dfad027c" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186087736 :knowledge-point/questions "38400543-5454-505c-aa07-5aa5dfad027c"] [:db/add "3c3c55dd-672c-5ddc-91c3-0760b1cc26c9" :answer/id #uuid "3c3c55dd-672c-5ddc-91c3-0760b1cc26c9"] [:db/add "3c3c55dd-672c-5ddc-91c3-0760b1cc26c9" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3c3c55dd-672c-5ddc-91c3-0760b1cc26c9" :answer/value "-2"] [:db/ensure "3c3c55dd-672c-5ddc-91c3-0760b1cc26c9" :answer/validate] [:db/add "dea6e07c-4bb9-51a7-8c20-d4e928225d80" :answer-field/id #uuid "dea6e07c-4bb9-51a7-8c20-d4e928225d80"] [:db/add "dea6e07c-4bb9-51a7-8c20-d4e928225d80" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "dea6e07c-4bb9-51a7-8c20-d4e928225d80" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "dea6e07c-4bb9-51a7-8c20-d4e928225d80" :answer-fie