-8e09f1d2210c"] [:db/ensure "fb9a59b6-8bf5-5a51-801c-176445c4e585" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "fb27c71d-a7e8-5211-9958-a8c4ea2fa0d8" :question/id #uuid "fb27c71d-a7e8-5211-9958-a8c4ea2fa0d8"] [:db/add "fb27c71d-a7e8-5211-9958-a8c4ea2fa0d8" :question/problem "Given that a curve is defined parametrically as\n\n$$\nx=2\\cos\\theta+1\n$$\n\n$$\ny=5\\sin\\theta-1\n$$\n\n$$\n0\\le \\theta<2\\pi\n$$\n\nwhat are the ranges of $x$ and $y$?\n\nThe range of $x$ is:\n\n{{field-1}} {{field-2}} $x\\le$ {{field-3}}.\n\nThe range of $y$ is:\n\n{{field-4}} $\\le y$ {{field-5}} {{field-6}}."] [:db/add "fb27c71d-a7e8-5211-9958-a8c4ea2fa0d8" :question/worked-solution "Consider each coordinate separately.\n\nFor $x$:\n\nOver the full turn, $\\cos\\theta$ attains both $-1$ and $1$, including at permitted parameter values.\n\nMultiply by $2$ and translate by $1$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-1 &\\le \\cos\\theta\\le 1 \\\\\n-2 &\\le 2\\cos\\theta\\le 2 \\\\\n-1 &\\le 2\\cos\\theta+1\\le 3 \\\\\n-1 &\\le x\\le 3.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus $-1\\le x\\le 3$.\n\nFor $y$:\n\nOver the full turn, $\\sin\\theta$ attains both $-1$ and $1$, including at permitted parameter values.\n\nMultiply by $5$ and translate by $-1$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-1 &\\le \\sin\\theta\\le 1 \\\\\n-5 &\\le 5\\sin\\theta\\le 5 \\\\\n-6 &\\le 5\\sin\\theta-1\\le 4 \\\\\n-6 &\\le y\\le 4.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus $-6\\le y\\le 4$.\n\nContinuity gives every value between the stated bounds. The coordinate extrema need not occur at the same parameter value."] [:db/add "fb27c71d-a7e8-5211-9958-a8c4ea2fa0d8" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "fb27c71d-a7e8-5211-9958-a8c4ea2fa0d8" :question/answer-fields "eaeaf725-b66a-58e3-8ff6-bc2f20c92de5"] [:db/add "fb27c71d-a7e8-5211-9958-a8c4ea2fa0d8" :question/answer-fields "9d716677-cf1d-5b38-b31d-8fb87372d75c"] [:db/add "fb27c71d-a7e8-5211-9958-a8c4ea2fa0d8" :question/answer-fields "dda26c20-c71c-5562-a82e-5191d333cdc6"] [:db/add "fb27c71d-a7e8-521