 "4cec452f-1dd6-5d49-87cc-a7c80781c2b8" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "21654950-6955-5149-b373-7d47e38b95e8" :answer/id #uuid "21654950-6955-5149-b373-7d47e38b95e8"] [:db/add "21654950-6955-5149-b373-7d47e38b95e8" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "21654950-6955-5149-b373-7d47e38b95e8" :answer/value "\\le"] [:db/ensure "21654950-6955-5149-b373-7d47e38b95e8" :answer/validate] [:db/add "acccfdf3-99cc-5937-8e2c-2e652715c6dd" :answer-field/id #uuid "acccfdf3-99cc-5937-8e2c-2e652715c6dd"] [:db/add "acccfdf3-99cc-5937-8e2c-2e652715c6dd" :answer-field/key "field-5"] [:db/add "acccfdf3-99cc-5937-8e2c-2e652715c6dd" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "acccfdf3-99cc-5937-8e2c-2e652715c6dd" :answer-field/choices "21654950-6955-5149-b373-7d47e38b95e8"] [:db/add "acccfdf3-99cc-5937-8e2c-2e652715c6dd" :answer-field/correct "21654950-6955-5149-b373-7d47e38b95e8"] [:db/ensure "acccfdf3-99cc-5937-8e2c-2e652715c6dd" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "e54a7f62-a658-5c47-bdde-6fac3abddf2b" :answer/id #uuid "e54a7f62-a658-5c47-bdde-6fac3abddf2b"] [:db/add "e54a7f62-a658-5c47-bdde-6fac3abddf2b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e54a7f62-a658-5c47-bdde-6fac3abddf2b" :answer/value "0"] [:db/ensure "e54a7f62-a658-5c47-bdde-6fac3abddf2b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "3e453175-e65e-5dec-92b3-057e2a9f62e4" :answer-field/id #uuid "3e453175-e65e-5dec-92b3-057e2a9f62e4"] [:db/add "3e453175-e65e-5dec-92b3-057e2a9f62e4" :answer-field/key "field-6"] [:db/add "3e453175-e65e-5dec-92b3-057e2a9f62e4" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "3e453175-e65e-5dec-92b3-057e2a9f62e4" :answer-field/choices "e54a7f62-a658-5c47-bdde-6fac3abddf2b"] [:db/add "3e453175-e65e-5dec-92b3-057e2a9f62e4" :answer-field/correct "e54a7f62-a658-5c47-bdde-6fac3abddf2b"] [:db/ensure "3e453175-e65e-5dec-92b3-057e2a9f62e4" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "010b6b83-9f96-5ddd-9bff-2bc2fa55fc10" :question/id #uuid "010b6b83-9f96-5ddd-9bff-2bc2fa55fc10"] [:db/add "010b6b83-9f96-5ddd-9bff-2bc2fa55fc10" :question/problem "Given that a curve is defined parametrically as\n\n$$\nx=2\\cos\\theta-2\n$$\n\n$$\ny=-2\\sin\\theta-2\n$$\n\n$$\n0\\le \\theta<2\\pi\n$$\n\nwhat are the ranges of $x$ and $y$?\n\nThe range of $x$ is:\n\n{{field-1}} {{field-2}} $x\\le$ {{field-3}}.\n\nThe range of $y$ is:\n\n{{field-4}} $\\le y$ {{field-5}} {{field-6}}."] [:db/add "010b6b83-9f96-5ddd-9bff-2bc2fa55fc10" :question/worked-solution "Consider each coordinate separately.\n\nFor $x$:\n\nOver the full turn, $\\cos\\theta$ attains both $-1$ and $1$, including at permitted parameter values.\n\nMultiply by $2$ and translate by $-2$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-1 &\\le \\cos\\theta\\le 1 \\\\\n-2 &\\le 2\\cos\\theta\\le 2 \\\\\n-4 &\\le 2\\cos\\theta-2\\le 0 \\\\\n-4 &\\le x\\le 0.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus $-4\\le x\\le 0$.\n\nFor $y$:\n\nOver the full turn, $\\sin\\theta$ attains both $-1$ and $1$, including at permitted parameter values.\n\nMultiplying by $-2$ reverses both comparisons; translate by $-2$, then write the bounds in increasing order.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-1 &\\le \\sin\\theta\\le 1 \\\\\n2 &\\ge-2\\sin\\theta\\ge-2 \\\\\n0 &\\ge-2\\sin\\theta-2\\ge-4 \\\\\n-4 &\\le y\\le 0.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus $-4\\le y\\le 0$.\n\nContinuity gives every value between the stated bounds. The coordinate extrema need not occur at the same parameter value."] [:db/add "010b6b83-9f96-5ddd-9bff-2bc2fa55fc10" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "010b6b83-9f96-5ddd-9bff-2bc2fa55fc10" :question/answer-fields "83d90a3d-3b73-5d21-b0e6-86605c9e96b9"] [:db/add "010b6b83-9f96-5ddd-9bff-2bc2fa55fc10" :question/answer-fields "60163b3b-0ba1-5168-8e08-a4e3e1465f03"] [:db/add "010b6b83-9f96-5ddd-9bff-2bc2fa55fc10" :question/answer-fields "54ed97a6-7487-5ac2-8a61-abb8f960573f"] [:db/add "010b6b83-9f96-5ddd-9bff-2bc2fa55fc10" :question/answer-fields "4cec452f-1dd6-5d49-87cc-a7c80781c2b8"] [:db/add "010b6b83-9f96-5ddd-9bff-2bc2fa55fc10" :question/answer-fields "ac