ta<2\\pi\n$$\n\nwhat are the ranges of $x$ and $y$?\n\nThe range of $x$ is:\n\n{{field-1}} {{field-2}} $x\\le$ {{field-3}}.\n\nThe range of $y$ is:\n\n{{field-4}} $\\le y$ {{field-5}} {{field-6}}."] [:db/add "55c5c094-f88d-59bc-b99b-93d95c8550af" :question/worked-solution "Consider each coordinate separately.\n\nFor $x$:\n\nOver the full turn, $\\cos\\theta$ attains both $-1$ and $1$, including at permitted parameter values.\n\nMultiplying by $-4$ reverses both comparisons; translate by $-1$, then write the bounds in increasing order.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-1 &\\le \\cos\\theta\\le 1 \\\\\n4 &\\ge-4\\cos\\theta\\ge-4 \\\\\n3 &\\ge-4\\cos\\theta-1\\ge-5 \\\\\n-5 &\\le x\\le 3.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus $-5\\le x\\le 3$.\n\nFor $y$:\n\nOver the full turn, $\\sin\\theta$ attains both $-1$ and $1$, including at permitted parameter values.\n\nMultiply by $3$ and translate by $2$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-1 &\\le \\sin\\theta\\le 1 \\\\\n-3 &\\le 3\\sin\\theta\\le 3 \\\\\n-1 &\\le 3\\sin\\theta+2\\le 5 \\\\\n-1 &\\le y\\le 5.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus $-1\\le y\\le 5$.\n\nContinuity gives every value between the stated bounds. The coordinate extrema need not occur at the same parameter value."] [:db/add "55c5c094-f88d-59bc-b99b-93d95c8550af" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "55c5c094-f88d-59bc-b99b-93d95c8550af" :question/answer-fields "675a12ad-0ab5-579f-8d27-778df9145d10"] [:db/add "55c5c094-f88d-59bc-b99b-93d95c8550af" :question/answer-fields "274ed126-2831-5558-9029-a5ce8ae03761"] [:db/add "55c5c094-f88d-59bc-b99b-93d95c8550af" :question/answer-fields "3cc1de9f-42ed-54b2-90bb-b360cf684e3e"] [:db/add "55c5c094-f88d-59bc-b99b-93d95c8550af" :question/answer-fields "8ff5eef5-9e0b-5628-bb00-61d8c240f294"] [:db/add "55c5c094-f88d-59bc-b99b-93d95c8550af" :question/answer-fields "c8b0c32c-b2e5-5e98-949d-58e6e90ecbc0"] [:db/add "55c5c094-f88d-59bc-b99b-93d95c8550af" :question/answer-fields "d23ea033-1b2a-5edc-a7eb-93d7e350082f"] [:db/ensure 