nswer/value "\\le"] [:db/ensure "e186b197-80a1-542b-968b-26dac6b3beb5" :answer/validate] [:db/add "bc5fc555-c853-5b6e-8524-e4348bed1d82" :answer-field/id #uuid "bc5fc555-c853-5b6e-8524-e4348bed1d82"] [:db/add "bc5fc555-c853-5b6e-8524-e4348bed1d82" :answer-field/key "field-5"] [:db/add "bc5fc555-c853-5b6e-8524-e4348bed1d82" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "bc5fc555-c853-5b6e-8524-e4348bed1d82" :answer-field/choices "e186b197-80a1-542b-968b-26dac6b3beb5"] [:db/add "bc5fc555-c853-5b6e-8524-e4348bed1d82" :answer-field/correct "e186b197-80a1-542b-968b-26dac6b3beb5"] [:db/ensure "bc5fc555-c853-5b6e-8524-e4348bed1d82" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "c6cdb3ea-3651-57e2-9399-58f60c99816e" :answer/id #uuid "c6cdb3ea-3651-57e2-9399-58f60c99816e"] [:db/add "c6cdb3ea-3651-57e2-9399-58f60c99816e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "c6cdb3ea-3651-57e2-9399-58f60c99816e" :answer/value "5"] [:db/ensure "c6cdb3ea-3651-57e2-9399-58f60c99816e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "627e869c-a669-5d4e-973f-04442bf84862" :answer-field/id #uuid "627e869c-a669-5d4e-973f-04442bf84862"] [:db/add "627e869c-a669-5d4e-973f-04442bf84862" :answer-field/key "field-6"] [:db/add "627e869c-a669-5d4e-973f-04442bf84862" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "627e869c-a669-5d4e-973f-04442bf84862" :answer-field/choices "c6cdb3ea-3651-57e2-9399-58f60c99816e"] [:db/add "627e869c-a669-5d4e-973f-04442bf84862" :answer-field/correct "c6cdb3ea-3651-57e2-9399-58f60c99816e"] [:db/ensure "627e869c-a669-5d4e-973f-04442bf84862" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "6cd7f361-7287-5379-9635-83d4142f0de3" :question/id #uuid "6cd7f361-7287-5379-9635-83d4142f0de3"] [:db/add "6cd7f361-7287-5379-9635-83d4142f0de3" :question/problem "Given that a curve is defined parametrically as\n\n$$\nx=-\\frac{5}{2}\\sin\\theta-2\n$$\n\n$$\ny=-3\\cos\\theta+2\n$$\n\n$$\n0\\le \\theta<2\\pi\n$$\n\nwhat are the ranges of $x$ and $y$?\n\nThe range of $x$ is:\n\n{{field-1}} {{field-2}} $x\\le$ {{field-3}}.\n\nThe range of $y$ is:\n\n{{field-4}} $\\le y$ {{field-5}} {{field-6}}."] [:db/add "6cd7f361-7287-5379-9635-83d4142f0de3" :question/worked-solution "Consider each coordinate separately.\n\nFor $x$:\n\nOver the full turn, $\\sin\\theta$ attains both $-1$ and $1$, including at permitted parameter values.\n\nMultiplying by $-\\frac{5}{2}$ reverses both comparisons; translate by $-2$, then write the bounds in increasing order.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-1 &\\le \\sin\\theta\\le 1 \\\\\n\\frac{5}{2} &\\ge-\\frac{5}{2}\\sin\\theta\\ge-\\frac{5}{2} \\\\\n\\frac{1}{2} &\\ge-\\frac{5}{2}\\sin\\theta-2\\ge-\\frac{9}{2} \\\\\n-\\frac{9}{2} &\\le x\\le \\frac{1}{2}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus $-\\frac{9}{2}\\le x\\le \\frac{1}{2}$.\n\nFor $y$:\n\nOver the full turn, $\\cos\\theta$ attains both $-1$ and $1$, including at permitted parameter values.\n\nMultiplying by $-3$ reverses both comparisons; translate by $2$, then write the bounds in increasing order.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-1 &\\le \\cos\\theta\\le 1 \\\\\n3 &\\ge-3\\cos\\theta\\ge-3 \\\\\n5 &\\ge-3\\cos\\theta+2\\ge-1 \\\\\n-1 &\\le y\\le 5.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus $-1\\le y\\le 5$.\n\nContinuity gives every value between the stated bounds. The coordinate extrema need not occur at the same parameter value."] [:db/add "6cd7f361-7287-5379-9635-83d4142f0de3" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "6cd7f361-7287-5379-9635-83d4142f0de3" :question/answer-fields "f4dbf1c9-99fc-5567-8594-28b72ea46f7f"] [:db/add "6cd7f361-7287-5379-9635-83d4142f0de3" :question/answer-fields "05b60053-b6ae-5fd2-99eb-39345af5293a"] [:db/add "6cd7f361-7287-5379-9635-83d4142f0de3" :question/answer-fields "00c2dea5-041c-589b-bf52-93e0eeee47f2"] [:db/add "6cd7f361-7287-5379-9635-83d4142f0de3" :question/answer-fields "6f7eae81-a883-5682-b052-28d14fda6e8a"] [:db/add "6cd7f361-7287-5379-9635-83d4142f0de3" :question/answer-fields "bc5fc555-c853-5b6e-8524-e4348bed1d82"] [:db/add "6cd7f361-7287-5379-9635-83d4142f0de3" :question/answ