2}} $x\\le$ {{field-3}}.\n\nThe range of $y$ is:\n\n{{field-4}} $\\le y$ {{field-5}} {{field-6}}."] [:db/add "5a7ff3e4-7c18-51c3-be32-08f2fa369d8b" :question/worked-solution "Consider each coordinate separately.\n\nFor $x$:\n\nOver the full turn, $\\sin\\theta$ attains both $-1$ and $1$, including at permitted parameter values.\n\nMultiplying by $-4$ reverses both comparisons; translate by $-1$, then write the bounds in increasing order.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-1 &\\le \\sin\\theta\\le 1 \\\\\n4 &\\ge-4\\sin\\theta\\ge-4 \\\\\n3 &\\ge-4\\sin\\theta-1\\ge-5 \\\\\n-5 &\\le x\\le 3.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus $-5\\le x\\le 3$.\n\nFor $y$:\n\nOver the full turn, $\\cos\\theta$ attains both $-1$ and $1$, including at permitted parameter values.\n\nMultiply by $4$ and translate by $-3$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-1 &\\le \\cos\\theta\\le 1 \\\\\n-4 &\\le 4\\cos\\theta\\le 4 \\\\\n-7 &\\le 4\\cos\\theta-3\\le 1 \\\\\n-7 &\\le y\\le 1.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus $-7\\le y\\le 1$.\n\nContinuity gives every value between the stated bounds. The coordinate extrema need not occur at the same parameter value."] [:db/add "5a7ff3e4-7c18-51c3-be32-08f2fa369d8b" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "5a7ff3e4-7c18-51c3-be32-08f2fa369d8b" :question/answer-fields "831a095f-8424-5c3a-8236-574b6f0a7478"] [:db/add "5a7ff3e4-7c18-51c3-be32-08f2fa369d8b" :question/answer-fields "c6efbe26-868a-51c5-85d5-9d72e6c40528"] [:db/add "5a7ff3e4-7c18-51c3-be32-08f2fa369d8b" :question/answer-fields "60584bca-ee92-5244-948d-af908420d6d8"] [:db/add "5a7ff3e4-7c18-51c3-be32-08f2fa369d8b" :question/answer-fields "edc96929-9f11-55d5-8515-f44afc706716"] [:db/add "5a7ff3e4-7c18-51c3-be32-08f2fa369d8b" :question/answer-fields "54219837-b20d-5603-8aca-beca79ca11da"] [:db/add "5a7ff3e4-7c18-51c3-be32-08f2fa369d8b" :question/answer-fields "512fe8ff-9cf3-5407-a445-ffde7decd4ca"] [:db/ensure "5a7ff3e4-7c18-51c3-be32-08f2fa369d8b" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186087736 :knowledge-poin